# Invoice originals (Phase 2.5). INVOICE_STORAGE_DIR defaults to ./var/invoices/
# — a SIBLING of public/, never inside it. Next serves public/ statically ahead
# of the application, so an invoice placed there is retrievable unauthenticated:
# no session, no role check, no organization predicate. That is simultaneously a
# cross-tenant breach (invariant 9) and a cost-visibility breach (invariant 8),
# and it is the AR-1 finding this directory choice exists to close. The only
# read path is GET /api/invoices/[id]/file.
/var/

# Real vendor invoice PDFs must never land in tests/ — a real Southern Glazer's
# invoice PDF with real pricing was used locally to reproduce and verify the
# Slice-4/5 extraction fixes (open-items.md #36) and was excluded from that
# commit by hand rather than by any rule, so nothing stopped a future
# `git add -A` from putting real supplier pricing into git history. Synthetic
# markdown fixtures belong in the test files themselves, not real vendor PDFs
# under tests/.
tests/*.pdf

# Jcode / Codex agent config — local tooling, not part of the project
.agents/
.codex/

# codegraph
.codegraph/
